                "message": "✨ feat: show the BibTeX works of the author of the current note\n\nsp-author-notes-bibtex-author lists the entries that name the author note in\nthe buffer (title and aliases), in a sp-batch-report with works not yet in the\nnote first, and adds the chosen ones.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNi9EoHmHrUjd52v9LXg",
